  "prefLabel": "Ins 6103.01 Applicability and Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 6103.01 Applicability and Scope. This part shall be applicable to all ancillary health insurance policies issued or provided by a carrier on an individual basis, except dental and vision expense policies.\n\nSource. #12630, eff 9-28-18",
